            "textentryhtml":"[Possibly Emmerich Gallery, in 1965]. Nora Wise; the Duane Family, by 1981; gift to the Princeton University Art Museum by Carolyn Duane in memory of Dr. Richard B. Duane, 2005.",
            "remarks":null
